@startuml
title Diagrama de Implantação - Gabinete Virtual

skinparam shadowing false

node "Usuário Interno" as User {
  artifact "Navegador Web" as Browser
}

node "Cidadão" as Citizen {
  artifact "WhatsApp" as WhatsAppClient
}

cloud "Hospedagem Frontend" as FEHost {
  artifact "React App (SPA)" as ReactApp
}

node "Servidor de Aplicação" as AppSrv {
  node "Proxy Reverso\nNginx/Apache" as ReverseProxy

  node "Container Backend" as BackendNode {
    artifact "Laravel API" as Laravel
    artifact "Worker de Filas" as Worker
  }

  node "Container Chatbot" as ChatbotNode {
    artifact "FastAPI Chatbot" as FastAPI
    artifact "Validadores\nidioma / toxicidade /\nsimilaridade" as Validators
  }

  node "Container Realtime" as RealtimeNode {
    artifact "Servidor WebSocket" as WebSocket
  }
}

node "Servidor de Banco de Dados" as DBNode {
  database "MySQL" as MySQL
}

node "Armazenamento de Arquivos" as FS {
  folder "S3/Local" as FileStore
}

cloud "Serviços Externos" as Ext {
  artifact "WhatsApp Business API" as MetaWhatsApp
}

User -down-> FEHost : HTTPS
Citizen -down-> MetaWhatsApp : mensagens
FEHost -down-> ReverseProxy : HTTPS
MetaWhatsApp -down-> ReverseProxy : webhook HTTPS

ReverseProxy -down-> Laravel : HTTP/FastCGI
ReverseProxy -down-> FastAPI : HTTP
ReverseProxy -down-> WebSocket : WS/WSS

Laravel -down-> MySQL : TCP 3306
Worker -down-> MySQL : leitura/escrita
FastAPI -down-> MySQL : sessões e contexto
WebSocket -down-> MySQL : tokens / leitura inicial

Laravel -down-> FileStore : upload/download
FastAPI -down-> MetaWhatsApp : API Graph / HTTPS
Worker -down-> MetaWhatsApp : notificações a cidadãos
Worker -down-> WebSocket : broadcast de alertas
Laravel -down-> WebSocket : publicação de eventos
FastAPI -down-> Laravel : REST interno
ReactApp -down-> WebSocket : assinatura de alertas

note right of AppSrv
Componentes implantados:
- backend REST principal
- chatbot com webhook e validações
- servidor realtime para alertas
- worker para processamento assíncrono
end note

@enduml
